  "method": "Monthly means weighted by calendar days within each year; equal-weight annual means for baseline and future periods. Spherical latitude-strip areas from published latitude bounds, with fractional overlap at band boundaries; equal-width longitude cells. No land mask. Anomaly subtracts each cell\u2019s 1995\u20132014 mean before spatial aggregation. Kelvin differences have the same magnitude as Celsius differences; no offset is applied to anomalies.",
